  "description": "You like to ride fast. Maybe you’re looking to expand your mileage during your regular ride times. Maybe you just want to keep up with a riding partner. Maybe you want to train for a bigger adventure. The Rove HD brings the world of electric riding to the masses with a more budget-friendly hub drive motor. Its design is easy on the eyes and maintains that classic Rove style. Like the analog Rove, the Rove HD runs wider tires ready to take you across mixed surfaces with ease. A 418wh battery provides just the right amount of assist to get after those longer rides you’ve been eyeing up. Whether your aim is to ride longer or faster, or just to have more fun the Rove HD delivers in spades.\nLearn More In Our Complete Guide To Hub Drive Electric Bikes",
